      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استجهلهُ</span></b>  <i>He reckoned him,</i> or <i>esteemed him,</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاهِل</span> [or <i>ignorant,</i> &amp;c.]. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He,</i> or
<i>it, excited him to lightness,</i> or <i>levity, and unsteadiness.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتجْهَلَتِ الرِّيحُ الغُصْنَ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>The wind put the branch into a state of commotion.</i> (K, TA.)

